<h3>Version 1.0.5</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Reworked the main window: your cloud and its folder come first, the chat
      list moved into a section of its own.</li>
  <li>Chats are ordered sensibly now — your cloud on top, then the chats you
      already connected — and there is a search field.</li>
  <li>An active licence is marked plainly, with a green check.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
