</style>
<h3>Version 1.0.4</h3>
<ul>
  <li>The licence now follows your Telegram account instead of a particular Mac.
      Reinstall the system or move to a new computer — sign in and it keeps working.</li>
  <li>The licence is kept in the Keychain, so it survives reinstalling the app.</li>
  <li>Clearer wording when a key belongs to a different Telegram account.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
